{
  "type": "agent",
  "provider": "openclaw",
  "agent": "main",
  "thinking": "low",
  "timeout": 1800,
  "gateway_url": "127.0.0.1:18789",
  "icon": "🦞",

  "_comment": [
    "OpenClaw as an external agent: it does its own thinking, keeps its own",
    "session memory and has its own tools, so LOS only hands it this agenda",
    "and a list of MCP tools.",
    "Install OpenClaw and run 'openclaw configure' — it reads its gateway",
    "address from its own config, so gateway_url here is informational.",
    "'agent' is the OpenClaw profile to use ('main' by default; the label in",
    ".config can override it with agent=<name>).",
    "'thinking' is low, medium or high."
  ]
}
